{10 = 10-20}
1010.	May the heart of your god be well disposed towards you! 
1011.	Let the eye of the @fsux{gakkul} vat be our eye, 
1012.	and let the heart of the @fsux{gakkul} vat be our heart! 
1013.	What makes your heart feel wonderful in itself  
1014.	also makes our hearts feel wonderful in themselves! 
1015.	We are in a happy mood, 
1016.	our hearts are joyful! 
1017.	You have poured a libation over the fated brick, 
1018.	and you have laid the foundations in peace and prosperity -- now may @wDN{Ninkasi} dwell with you! 
1019.	She should pour beer and wine for you! 
1020.	Let the pouring of the sweet liquor resound pleasantly for you! 

{21 = 21-31}
2121.	In the troughs made with @fsux{bur} grass, there is sweet beer. 
2122.	I will have the cupbearers, the boys and the brewers stand by. 
2123.	As I spin around the lake of beer, 
2124.	while feeling wonderful, feeling wonderful, 
2125.	while drinking beer, 
2126.	in a blissful mood, 
2127.	while drinking alcohol and feeling exhilarated, 
2128.	with joy in the heart and a contented liver -- my heart is a heart filled with joy! 
2129.	I clothe my contented liver in a garment fit for a queen! 
2130.	The heart of @wDN{Inana} is happy once again; 
2131.	the heart of @wDN{Inana} is happy once again! 

